cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ariadne in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Ariadne: A Coral-Centered Terpene Synthase Discovery and CeeSs Prioritization Platform"
abstract: >-
  Ariadne is a tree-native, four-stage computational platform for coral terpene
  synthase (TPS) mining and cembrene-class (CeeSs) prioritization, combining
  profile-HMM-guided discovery, coverage- and length-aware filtering, TPS
  feature-space embedding with supervised dimensionality reduction, and an
  optional ESM2-based scoring layer for CeeSs candidates.
type: software
authors:
